{% extends "base.jinja" %}

{% block subject %}Your email is ready{% endblock subject %}

{% block body_markdown %}
{{ user.first_name }},

Your emails are now available in Convictional. Here's how to make the most of it:

**Search across everything** — Press ⌘K to find emails, meetings, and perform research.

<img src="{{ url_for_static_file('images/command_palette.gif') }}" width="400" style="margin-bottom: 36px;">

**Collaborate on email** — Assign threads to teammates, chat about them, and draft emails together.

<img src="{{ url_for_static_file('images/collaborators.gif') }}" width="400" style="margin-bottom: 36px;">
{% if is_calendar_connected %}

**Check upcoming meetings** — Your meeting navigation bar shows what's next on your calendar.

<img src="{{ url_for_static_file('images/meeting_navigation_bar.gif') }}" width="400" style="margin-bottom: 36px;">
{% endif %}

**Navigate faster** — Press ? to see keyboard shortcuts.

<img src="{{ url_for_static_file('images/hotkeys.png') }}" width="400" style="margin-bottom: 36px;">
{% if user.is_admin %}

**Invite your team** — Open the ⋮ menu (top right), then [Team Members]({{ url_for('organization_users_index') }}).

<img src="{{ url_for_static_file('images/team_members.gif') }}" width="400" style="margin-bottom: 36px;">
{% endif %}

---
[Open Convictional]({{ url_for('mailbox_index') }})
{% endblock body_markdown %}
